文","text":"张既说马腾会击郭援，马腾遣子马超将精兵逆之","evidence":["zhonghua-q-7cba893c0ffd0bddf47d"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-850ff03c775ab9e4d2f2","label":"正文","text":"郭援轻渡汾，济水未半被击大破，斩郭援降单于","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2e8887a3c16d01c3eeb0"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-d37e6363560c37386f99","label":"裴注·司马彪战略","text":"袁尚遣高幹、郭援将兵数万人与匈奴单于寇河东，遣使与马腾、韩遂等连和，腾等阴许之","evidence":["zhonghua-q-f7bba20e9f2113d463ac"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-87c8319a25f117a8c617","label":"裴注·司马彪战略","text":"傅幹说马腾顺逆之理，腾惧","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2a97759cb8565524e9b2"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-2329626f684957980d61","label":"裴注·司马彪战略","text":"傅幹再劝马腾引兵讨郭援，内外击之断袁氏之臂","evidence":["zhonghua-q-19fd1c45e7c404c4e12f"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-0d45bdd53acd10e6ae24","label":"裴注·司马彪战略","text":"马腾敬从傅幹之教，遣子马超将精兵万余人并将韩遂等兵，与钟繇会击郭援等，大破之","evidence":["zhonghua-q-21fd55277324a512ed9e"]},{"id":"liusima-a-cc6f093325bc4e03afd7","label":"正文","text":"袁尚遣郭援、高幹及匈奴单于取平阳，发使与关中诸将合从","evidence":["liusima-q-af31a676aa3b231c22c0"]},{"id":"liusima-a-891ef95d736e44658093","label":"正文","text":"钟繇遣张既说马腾等，腾等从之","evidence":["liusima-q-5228f5d8a72814c227f1"]},{"id":"liusima-a-cc359f80a703218919df","label":"正文","text":"马超将兵万余人与钟繇会击幹援，大破之，斩援首，幹及单于皆降","evidence":["liusima-q-f2479d99d841b7989d13"]},{"id":"lizang-a-22ff86deb002e9614d1d","label":"正文","text":"袁谭遣郭援高幹等略取河东","evidence":["lizang-q-5b99cf8e7236f639d2b5"]},{"id":"lizang-a-56e048afa5e1951af715","label":"正文","text":"太祖使钟繇率关中诸将讨郭援高幹","evidence":["lizang-q-4e9d00399c0ce2056d13"]},{"id":"lizang-a-92b9fb77ec64a87fda43","label":"正文","text":"庞德随马超拒郭援高幹于平阳，为军锋大破之，亲斩援首","evidence":["lizang-q-ee0fcf8d9d95a8a89aea"]},{"id":"lizang-a-9b73fad6fe2d56353d75","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"《魏略》：德手斩一级不知是援，战罢众言援死不得其首，德晚后于鞬中出一头","evidence":["lizang-q-d9c6a20001d63fc4e6c2"]},{"id":"lizang-a-95df7df2056685c16379","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"《魏略》：钟繇见援首而哭，德谢繇，繇曰援虽我甥乃国贼也卿何谢之","evidence":["lizang-q-4924e47843d48d5bf19e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0181","role":"征讨","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023b-q"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0013","role":"征讨","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0235","role":"侵略","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023b-q"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0014","role":"侵略","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"置郭援者；遣兵之主","evidence":["zhonghua-q-04a7d3de46fac2ba1c59","zhonghua-q-f7bba20e9f2113d463ac"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"进说马腾者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-7cba893c0ffd0bddf47d"]},{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"将精兵逆击者；率精兵参战者；将精兵会击者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-7cba893c0ffd0bddf47d","zhonghua-q-2e8887a3c16d01c3eeb0","zhonghua-q-21fd55277324a512ed9e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"阴许连和者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-f7bba20e9f2113d463ac"]},{"person":"wudi-p0337","role":"进说者；再劝者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2a97759cb8565524e9b2","zhonghua-q-19fd1c45e7c404c4e12f"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"袁尚拒之于黎阳","evidence":["liusima-q-af31a676aa3b231c22c0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0163","role":"遣郭援高幹略河东","evidence":["lizang-q-5b99cf8e7236f639d2b5"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0011","role":"为军锋破援幹亲斩援；手斩一级后出其首；谢繇","evidence":["lizang-q-ee0fcf8d9d95a8a89aea","lizang-q-d9c6a20001d63fc4e6c2","lizang-q-4924e47843d48d5bf19e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"袁绍卒后至建安八年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o023b-q","source_order":[10,121,"O023b"],"order":2429}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"guanzhang-p0013","name":"马腾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"guanzhang-p0014","name":"郭援","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0011","name":"庞德","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wgc-p0068","name":"张既","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0048","name":"韩遂","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0163","name":"袁谭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0181","name":"钟繇","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0235","name":"高幹","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0282","name":"马超","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0337","name":"傅幹","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-5228f5d8a72814c227f1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d158b35e0c99bd1badc0","layer":"original","quote":"司隶校尉钟繇遣既，说将军马腾等。既为言利害，腾等从之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-af31a676aa3b231c22c0","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d158b35e0c99bd1badc0","layer":"original","quote":"袁尚拒太祖于黎阳，遣所置河东太守郭援，并州刺史高幹及匈奴单于，取平阳；发使，西与关中诸将合从","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-f2479d99d841b7989d13","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d158b35e0c99bd1badc0","layer":"original","quote":"腾遣子超将兵万余人，与繇会击幹、援；大破之，斩援首，幹及单于皆降","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":77,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-4924e47843d48d5bf19e","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-bfe551423d3150bed6a9","layer":"pei","quote":"繇见之而哭。德谢繇，繇曰：‘援虽我甥，乃国贼也！卿何谢之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6cf0ffc369313cfa3fa7","start":55,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-4e9d00399c0ce2056d13","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-77cf8e238c8aa2ff298d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖使钟繇率关中诸将讨之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":80,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-5b99cf8e7236f639d2b5","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-77cf8e238c8aa2ff298d","layer":"original","quote":"谭遣郭援、高幹等略取河东","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":67,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-d9c6a20001d63fc4e6c2","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-bfe551423d3150bed6a9","layer":"pei","quote":"德手斩一级，不知是援。战罢之后，众人皆言援死而不得其首。援，钟繇之甥。德晚后于鞬中出一头","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6cf0ffc369313cfa3fa7","start":10,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ee0fcf8d9d95a8a89aea","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-77cf8e238c8aa2ff298d","layer":"original","quote":"德随腾子超，拒援、幹于平阳。德为军锋，进攻援、幹，大破之，亲斩援首","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":93,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-o023b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-64b6e45c68fb16b80ee9","layer":"original","quote":"而高幹、郭援侵略河东，关右震动。钟繇帅马腾等，击破之，语在《繇传》。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-04a7d3de46fac2ba1c59","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"袁尚所置河东太守郭援到河东，众甚盛，诸将议欲释之去。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-19fd1c45e7c404c4e12f","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-02d2da358aaec0e17eb7","layer":"pei","quote":"幹曰：‘智者转祸为福。今曹公与袁氏相持，而高幹、郭援独制河东；曹公虽有万全之计，不能禁河东之不危也。将军诚能引兵讨援，内外击之，其势必举。是将军一举，断袁氏之臂，解一方之急：曹公必重德将军。将军功名，竹帛不能尽载也。唯将军审所择！’","attribution":"裴注·司马彪战略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3d2327301bdfe436b774","start":205,"end":321,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-21fd55277324a512ed9e","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-02d2da358aaec0e17eb7","layer":"pei","quote":"腾曰：‘敬从教！’于是遣子超，将精兵万余人，并将遂等兵，与繇会击援等，大破之。”","attribution":"裴注·司马彪战略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3d2327301bdfe436b774","start":321,"end":361,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-2a97759cb8565524e9b2","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-02d2da358aaec0e17eb7","layer":"pei","quote":"傅幹说腾曰：‘古人有言：“顺道者昌，逆德者亡。”曹公奉天子诛暴乱；法明国治，上下用命；有义必赏，无义必罚：可谓顺道矣。袁氏背王命；驱胡虏以陵中国，宽而多忌，仁而无断；兵虽强，实失天下心：可谓逆德矣。今将军既事有道，不尽其力，阴怀两端，欲以坐观成败；吾恐成败既定，奉辞责罪，将军先为诛首矣。’于是腾惧。","attribution":"裴注·司马彪战略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3d2327301bdfe436b774","start":55,"end":205,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-2e8887a3c16d01c3eeb0","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"援至，果轻渡汾〖6〗；众止之，不从。济水未半，击，大破之。﹝一﹞斩援，降单于","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":179,"end":217,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-7cba893c0ffd0bddf47d","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"张既说马腾会击援〖5〗，腾遣子超，将精兵逆之。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":156,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-9fdc2a4faf98bee96821","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"繇曰：“袁氏方强，援之来，关中阴与之通；所以未悉叛者，顾吾威名故耳。若弃而去，示之以弱；所在之民，谁非寇仇？纵吾欲归，其得至乎？此为未战先自败也！且援刚愎好胜，必易吾军〖4〗；若渡汾为营，及其未济击之，可大克也。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-f6295e9b48de7d7415cc","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"其后，匈奴单于作乱平阳，繇帅诸军围之，未拔。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-f7bba20e9f2113d463ac","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-02d2da358aaec0e17eb7","layer":"pei","quote":"袁尚遣高幹、郭援，将兵数万人，与匈奴单于寇河东。遣使与马腾、韩遂等连和，腾等阴许之。","attribution":"裴注·司马彪战略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3d2327301bdfe436b774","start":13,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
